From 48c04b1319250428c2e2edc76bae1838e5d5a878 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hmtheboy154 <buingoc67@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Mar 2026 10:02:04 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] recovery: enable console management

This patch enables switching to a virtual terminal (console) by pressing Alt+F1,
and returning to the recovery GUI using Alt+F7, similar to Android-x86/BlissOS.

- Implements a VT manager thread in minui graphics to handle SIGUSR1/SIGUSR2.
- Adds DropMaster/SetMaster to DRM and FBDEV backends to properly route
  display buffers and CRTC states when switching contexts.
- Prevents input event processing and background progress thread drawing
  while in the console to avoid frame collision and frozen inputs.
- Triggers a full UI redraw upon returning to VT7.

Signed-off-by: hmtheboy154 <buingoc67@gmail.com>
